---
/**
 * Feature 3 - A cohort is production, frozen.
 *
 * The argument is drift, not effort: LangSmith makes rows easy to build and
 * they still age. The meters carry the contrast.
 */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="side side--competitor">
    <div class="side-head">
      <span class="side-label">Dataset you curate</span>
      <span class="side-sub">From cases, runs you add, or a queue</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <span class="case">example 1</span>
      <span class="case">example 2</span>
      <span class="case">example 3</span>
      <span class="case">example 4</span>
      <span class="case case--faded">example 5</span>
      <span class="case case--faded">example 6</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meter">
      <span class="meter-key">Reflects production</span>
      <span class="meter-bar"><span class="meter-fill meter-fill--part"></span></span>
      <span class="meter-val">as of when it was added</span>
    </div>
    <div class="note">Insights can point you at the traces worth adding. It still drifts the moment the product changes.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="side side--kitaru">
    <div class="side-head">
      <span class="side-label side-label--accent">Cohort version, frozen</span>
      <span class="side-sub">Sessions that already happened</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4821</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4822</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4830</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4844</span>
      <span class="case case--real mono">#4851</span>
      <span class="case case--flag mono">#4862 &#9873;</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meter">
      <span class="meter-key">Reflects production</span>
      <span class="meter-bar"><span class="meter-fill meter-fill--full"></span></span>
      <span class="meter-val meter-val--accent">it is production</span>
    </div>
    <div class="note">The member list never changes after creation. The flagged one is last Tuesday's incident, now a permanent regression case.</div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .side { border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 16px 14px;
    background: var(--color-surface); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .side--competitor { background: var(--color-surface-warm); }
  .side--kitaru { border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .side-head { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .side-label { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .side-label--accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .side-sub { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-secondary); }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .case { padding: 6px 4px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light); border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-bg); font-size: 10px; text-align: center; color: var(--color-secondary); }
  .case--faded { opacity: 0.45; border-style: dashed; }
  .case--real { border-color: var(--color-border-accent); color: var(--color-primary); }
  .case--flag { border-color: var(--color-accent); background: var(--color-accent-light);
    color: var(--color-accent-deep); font-weight: 700; }
  .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9.5px; }
  .meter { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  .meter-key { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted); }
  .meter-bar { display: block; height: 5px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--color-border-light); overflow: hidden; }
  .meter-fill { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; }
  .meter-fill--part { width: 45%; background: var(--color-muted); }
  .meter-fill--full { width: 100%; background: var(--color-accent); }
  .meter-val { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .meter-val--accent { color: var(--color-accent-deep); }
  .note { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border-light);
    font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .fig { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
